  "document": "Kevin Beard\nKevin Leon Beard (born January 20, 1981) is an American football coach and former player who currently serves as the wide receivers coach for University of Tennessee. He played college football at the University of Miami for Larry Coker, and afterward played professionally in the AF2 from 2005 to 2006, and in the Arena Football League in 2007. In 2015, Beard returned to Miami as the wide receivers coach."
